---
description: Docker, Compose, shell, and env-contract rules
globs:
  - "**/*.sh"
  - "docker-compose.yml"
  - "docker/**/*.Dockerfile"
  - "env/*.env*"
  - "installation_paths*.env"
---

- Use `.agents/skills/docker-patterns/`, `.agents/skills/deployment-patterns/`, `.agents/skills/env-contract-reviewer/`, and `.agents/skills/omero-runtime-verifier/` when relevant.
- Keep runtime changes environment-driven.
- Do not introduce `:latest`, inline secret defaults, or compose-level version sprawl.
- Preserve health checks and `security_opt: no-new-privileges:true`.
